OL,3,GNEWSAAmir Khan backs #500k fighter
OL,4,Awelfare campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer boxing world champion Amir Khan
OL,7,Fand Liverpool's Paul Smith are backing
OL,8,Fa campaign to raise #500,000 to help
OL,9,Finvestigate safety and welfare across
OL,10,Fcombat sports.
OL,12,FThe Liverpool-based Global Fighters'
OL,13,FAssociation (GFA) says the
OL,14,Finvestigation will examine fighters'
OL,15,Fmedical care, pay, contracts and
OL,16,Fsupport after retirement.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
