OL,3,GNEWSAAmir Khan backs #500k fighter
OL,4,Awelfare campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe group campaigns for better working
OL,7,Fconditions for boxers and other combat
OL,8,Fsports says the inquiry, to be led by
OL,9,Fbarrister Jonathan Caplan KC, will
OL,10,Fgather evidence from fighters, doctors,
OL,11,Freferees and promoters.
OL,13,FSmith, a former British champion, told
OL,14,FBBC News many fighters struggled with
OL,15,Fhigh medical costs and low earnings,
OL,16,Fand needed better protection.
